  "catalog_id": "SpiderCue",
  "draft": false,
  "note": "Halloween 2026 (lane Cues B, brief 2.6, concept C1_spider.jpg / C1b_spider.png), fourth build 2026-10-28 (Justin 18:45: redone to the concept): a glossy black shaft with red angular chevron bands spiralling up it and silk strung along it, a red crystal spear tip, a red hourglass gem at the collar, eight curved black leg-blades with red edges rooted at the end and sweeping forward round the butt behind the grip hand with silver silk between them, a rounded butt cap studded with glowing red eyes; red smoke and embers, silk webs. The silhouette is the crown of eight leg-blades (the reference itself); no crawling creatures.",
