    "Piece": {
      "Note": "spider_aura: four silk droplines with dew beads (the web wheels and hourglass charms are gone: no flat discs, the gem is on the body)."
    },
    "Moving": {
      "Note": "The droplines swing (the aura piece); the eight leg-blades breathe on their own bones; the gem and the twelve eyes pulse; the halo and the Silk strands pulse."
    },
    "Aura": {
      "Note": "Mythic (brief 2.6), fifth build (coordinator 19:08: red atmosphere, no web sprites): a dense crimson smoke haze and an additive crimson glow round the butt and the crown, red embers off the blades, silk motes, silver glints, sparks, a crimson glint at the gem, red-white glints over the blades, dew drips falling from the silk; silk pops (a silk star pop, a crimson pop, silk sparks); one crimson halo beam and four live-spun Silk strands between the cue's points; two crimson lights (the crown, the gem); crimson outline. About 113.15 particles a second before BackRateScale (budget 120).",
